{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88bd6006945d2809989","chatId":"2389e60e43d54cb4abef13fcabf5bc75","sessionId":null,"userId":67745,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1299,"promptTokens":1468,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:15"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908942427422655,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88bd6006945d2809988","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369675327,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88bd6006945d2809988","chatId":"2389e60e43d54cb4abef13fcabf5bc75","sessionId":null,"userId":67745,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n等了约会对象将近两个小时之后，罗杰正考虑离开。这时他听到身后有一个熟悉的声音，是他的约会对象杰西卡。她疯狂地为迟到道歉，并解释说她是因为帮助了困在高速公路上的一家人才迟到的。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，罗杰最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 失望\nB) 钦佩\nC) 生气\nD) 尴尬\nE) 感激\nF) 悔恨\n\n## 问题 2\n罗杰为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他的约会对象因为在路上帮助别人才迟到了\nB) 罗杰因为迟到而道歉\nC) 罗杰被堵车困住了\nD) 罗杰在两小时后到达了约会地点","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908942427422655,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88bd6006945d2809989","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369675324,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"43a0807797334a8c91a8e6a0863f0123"}